        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Icons are the result of applying [`default_prefix()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/691c5f38f575b572d0c857bd22c35be9a1512925/doc/mini-files.txt#L820) which is used by default as `config.content.prefix`.\r\n\r\nHere is an example of how to override it so that there is an extra space before an icon:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal prefix = function(fs_entry)\r\n  local icon, hl = MiniFiles.default_prefix(fs_entry)\r\n  return ' ' .. icon, hl\r\nend\r\nrequire('mini.files').setup({ content = { prefix = prefix } })\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2024-07-31T09:38:27Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1062#issuecomment-2260095070",
