        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi, @echasnovski I've noticed this visual bug ↓\r\n![Untitled](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b80de25-ec78-4901-9f16-55599b1b51f9)\r\nThis only happens when a floating window has a long directory title, becomes contracted and unfocused makes the padding on the right gone and not consistent with the left padding as it doesn't appends an empty space in the end.\r\n\r\nThank you for this wonderful update with bookmarks, its nice to have :>",
            "created_at": "2024-09-10T12:51:54Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1062#issuecomment-2340658715",
